{"id":"e23ce64dcd9dfdbf","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-wave-front-set.md","title":"Wave Front Set","display":"df-wave-front-set — Wave Front Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-wave-front-set","aliases":["58-df-wave-front-set","Wave Front Set"],"display":"df-wave-front-set — Wave Front Set","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-distribution.md]]","[[58-df-test-function]]","[[../batch03/58-df-open.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-wave-front-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-wave-front-set</span><span>Wave Front Set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-wave-front-set — Wave Front Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c53fe47de39217ed\" href=\"?note=c53fe47de39217ed\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-distribution.md\">../batch03/58-df-distribution.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"458fd0dccec3665f\" href=\"?note=458fd0dccec3665f\" title=\"58-df-test-function\">58-df-test-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef\" href=\"?note=ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-open.md\">../batch03/58-df-open.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\)</span> (Euclidean local domain)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}}\\in V\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}}\\in V\\)</span> (Euclidean standard topology)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\mathcal D&#39;(\\Omega)\">\\(u\\in\\mathcal D&#39;(\\Omega)\\)</span> (distribution on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c53fe47de39217ed\" href=\"?note=c53fe47de39217ed\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-distribution.md\">../batch03/58-df-distribution.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\in V\">\\(W\\in V\\)</span> (wave-front-set candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\\in\\mathcal D(\\Omega)\">\\(\\chi\\in\\mathcal D(\\Omega)\\)</span> (cutoff function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"458fd0dccec3665f\" href=\"?note=458fd0dccec3665f\" title=\"58-df-test-function\">58-df-test-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\hat{\\chi u}\">\\(\\hat{\\chi u}\\)</span> (Fourier transform of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi u\">\\(\\chi u\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WaveFrontSet}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{WaveFrontSet}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (relation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wave\\text{-}front\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WaveFrontSet}_S(W,u,\\Omega,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land u\\in\\mathcal D&#39;(\\Omega)\\land\\\\\n&amp;W=\\Bigl\\{(x,\\xi)\\in\\Omega\\times(\\mathbb R^n\\setminus\\{0\\})\\ \\Bigm|\\\n\\neg\\exists\\chi\\in\\mathcal D(\\Omega)\\;\\exists\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\bigl(\n\\chi(x)\\ne0\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Open}_S(\\Gamma;\\mathbb R^n\\setminus\\{0\\},\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}})\n\\land\\xi\\in\\Gamma\n\\land\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(r\\Gamma=\\Gamma)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall\\eta\\in\\Gamma\\;\n|\\widehat{\\chi u}(\\eta)|\\leq C(1+\\|\\eta\\|)^{-N}\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wave\\text{-}front\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WaveFrontSet}_S(W,u,\\Omega,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land u\\in\\mathcal D&#39;(\\Omega)\\land\\\\\n&amp;W=\\Bigl\\{(x,\\xi)\\in\\Omega\\times(\\mathbb R^n\\setminus\\{0\\})\\ \\Bigm|\\\n\\neg\\exists\\chi\\in\\mathcal D(\\Omega)\\;\\exists\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\bigl(\n\\chi(x)\\ne0\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Open}_S(\\Gamma;\\mathbb R^n\\setminus\\{0\\},\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}})\n\\land\\xi\\in\\Gamma\n\\land\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(r\\Gamma=\\Gamma)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall\\eta\\in\\Gamma\\;\n|\\widehat{\\chi u}(\\eta)|\\leq C(1+\\|\\eta\\|)^{-N}\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本原子采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\)</span> 的局部版本；流形版本需再以坐标图变换的不变性粘合。</li>\n<li>Wave front set: directions of non-smoothness combined with location; refined singular support</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(u) = \\emptyset \\iff u \\in C^\\infty\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}(u) = \\emptyset \\iff u \\in C^\\infty\\)</span>; encodes both location and direction of singularities</li>\n<li>奇异支集是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(u)\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}(u)\\)</span> 在底空间上的投影；这是定义后的性质。</li>\n<li>Application: hyperfunctions, boundary values of holomorphic functions, micro-local analysis</li>\n<li>Hörmander 乘积条件是不存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x,\\xi)\\in\\mathrm{WF}(u)\">\\((x,\\xi)\\in\\mathrm{WF}(u)\\)</span> 同时满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x,-\\xi)\\in\\mathrm{WF}(v)\">\\((x,-\\xi)\\in\\mathrm{WF}(v)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hörmander, Fourier Integral Operators</li>\n<li>Treves, Introduction to Pseudodifferential and Fourier Integral Operators</li>\n<li>Guillemin and Sternberg, Geometric Asymptotics</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-distribution.md","status":"resolved","id":"c53fe47de39217ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-distribution.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-test-function","status":"resolved","id":"458fd0dccec3665f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-test-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-open.md","status":"resolved","id":"ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-open.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-distribution.md","status":"resolved","id":"c53fe47de39217ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$u\\in\\mathcal D'(\\Omega)$ (distribution on $\\Omega$, see [[../batch03/58-df-distribution.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-test-function","status":"resolved","id":"458fd0dccec3665f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\chi\\in\\mathcal D(\\Omega)$ (cutoff function, see [[58-df-test-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in\\mathcal D'(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"W\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi\\in\\mathcal D(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\hat{\\chi u}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WaveFrontSet}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wave\\text{-}front\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WaveFrontSet}_S(W,u,\\Omega,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land u\\in\\mathcal D'(\\Omega)\\land\\\\\n&W=\\Bigl\\{(x,\\xi)\\in\\Omega\\times(\\mathbb R^n\\setminus\\{0\\})\\ \\Bigm|\\\n\\neg\\exists\\chi\\in\\mathcal D(\\Omega)\\;\\exists\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\bigl(\n\\chi(x)\\ne0\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Open}_S(\\Gamma;\\mathbb R^n\\setminus\\{0\\},\\tau_{\\mathrm{std}})\n\\land\\xi\\in\\Gamma\n\\land\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;(r\\Gamma=\\Gamma)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall\\eta\\in\\Gamma\\;\n|\\widehat{\\chi u}(\\eta)|\\leq C(1+\\|\\eta\\|)^{-N}\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}(u) = \\emptyset \\iff u \\in C^\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}(u)","display":false},{"tex":"(x,\\xi)\\in\\mathrm{WF}(u)","display":false},{"tex":"(x,-\\xi)\\in\\mathrm{WF}(v)","display":false}],"bytes":2392,"backlinks":[{"id":"7d28f785db64c74b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WaveFrontSet}_S(W,u,\\Omega,n)$ (see [[58-df-wave-front-set]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1374","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-wave-front-set.md|58-df-wave-front-set]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["c53fe47de39217ed","458fd0dccec3665f","ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef"]}